<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-NZ">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#090705">
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Explore the Foundry Boardroom and its four website directions."
  >
  <title>The Boardroom | Foundry by RKDB</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./boardroom.css">
</head>

<body>

  <div class="page-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="../" aria-label="Foundry home">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>

      <span class="brand-copy">
        <strong>FOUNDRY</strong>
        <small>BY RKDB</small>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a class="header-link" href="../the-foundry/">
      About Foundry
      <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </header>

  <main class="boardroom">

    <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="boardroom-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Foundry Boardroom</p>

      <h1 id="boardroom-title">What’s possible<span>.</span></h1>

      <div class="intro-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="intro-copy">
        <p>Four boards. Four different ways a website can take shape.</p>
        <p>But how it looks is only part of the story. <strong>Your website has a job to do.</strong></p>
        <p>These aren’t templates. They’re design prompts — different ways to think about what your site needs to say, show and do.</p>
        <p><strong>There’s one here that will fit your needs <em>perfectly</em>.</strong></p>
      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="boards" aria-label="Foundry website formats">

      <a class="board-card" href="./billboard/">
        <span class="glass-layer glass-layer--one" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="glass-layer glass-layer--two" aria-hidden="true"></span>

        <span class="board-number">01</span>

        <span class="board-icon" aria-hidden="true">B</span>

        <span class="board-main">
          <span class="board-label">Billboard</span>
          <strong>
            A polished online presence that gets to the point.
          </strong>
        </span>

        <span class="board-description">
          See the completed Billboard product and its three working business examples.
        </span>

        <span class="board-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>


      <a class="board-card" href="./noticeboard/">
        <span class="glass-layer glass-layer--one" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="glass-layer glass-layer--two" aria-hidden="true"></span>

        <span class="board-number">02</span>

        <span class="board-icon" aria-hidden="true">N</span>

        <span class="board-main">
          <span class="board-label">Noticeboard</span>
          <strong>
            A polished website with information you can keep current.
          </strong>
        </span>

        <span class="board-description">
          Perfect for organisations, clubs and service-based businesses.
        </span>

        <span class="board-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>


      <a class="board-card" href="./skateboard/">
        <span class="glass-layer glass-layer--one" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="glass-layer glass-layer--two" aria-hidden="true"></span>

        <span class="board-number">03</span>

        <span class="board-icon" aria-hidden="true">S</span>

        <span class="board-main">
          <span class="board-label">Skateboard</span>
          <strong>
            An immersive parallax site with smooth movement.
          </strong>
        </span>

        <span class="board-description">
          For brands that lead with visual storytelling and experience.
        </span>

        <span class="board-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>


      <a class="board-card" href="./springboard/">
        <span class="glass-layer glass-layer--one" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="glass-layer glass-layer--two" aria-hidden="true"></span>

        <span class="board-number">04</span>

        <span class="board-icon" aria-hidden="true">S</span>

        <span class="board-main">
          <span class="board-label">Springboard</span>
          <strong>
            A complete multi-page website with room to grow.
          </strong>
        </span>

        <span class="board-description">
          For businesses that need dedicated pages, deeper information and a broader online presence.
        </span>

        <span class="board-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>

    </section>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
